flowchart TD
    A{Disturbance Type?} -->|"Bare substrate<br/>(no soil)"| B["Primary Succession<br/>(centuries)"]
    A -->|"Soil intact<br/>(seed bank present)"| C["Secondary Succession<br/>(decades)"]

    B --> D["Pioneer Community<br/>Lichens, cyanobacteria, mosses<br/>Weathering begins"]
    C --> E["Pioneer Community<br/>Annual weeds, grasses<br/>Seed bank germinates"]

    D --> F{Mechanism?}
    E --> F

    F -->|"Facilitation<br/>(Connell-Slatyer)"| G["Early species improve<br/>conditions for later species<br/>(N-fixation, soil building)"]
    F -->|"Tolerance"| H["Later species establish<br/>independently; outcompete<br/>pioneers via shade tolerance"]
    F -->|"Inhibition"| I["Pioneers resist replacement;<br/>succession only when<br/>pioneers die or are removed"]

    G --> J["Intermediate Community<br/>Shrubs, shade-intolerant trees<br/>Increasing soil depth"]
    H --> J
    I --> J

    J --> K["Late-Successional Community<br/>Shade-tolerant canopy species<br/>Complex vertical structure<br/>High biomass, low NPP/biomass"]

    K --> L{Disturbance?}
    L -->|"Fire, storm,<br/>human clearing"| C
    L -->|"Stable"| M["Dynamic Equilibrium<br/>(not a fixed 'climax')"]

    style D fill:#f0ad4e,color:#000
    style E fill:#f0ad4e,color:#000
    style K fill:#5cb85c,color:#fff
    style M fill:#4a90d9,color:#fff
